# This run's text evidence is small (sub-200KB) and committed in full, the
# same convention socket_evidence_01/02/03 use. This file exists so a future
# rerun that turns on verbose Catch/compiler tracing, or that is repeated
# many times into this same directory tree, does not silently balloon the
# tracked tree with raw build output that carries no evidence value beyond
# what manifest.json's hashes and completion.json's status already capture.
configure.log.verbose
build.log.verbose
*.pcap
*.pcapng
